OL,3,GNEWSAFatal bin lorry crash police
OL,4,Ainterview man
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating a fatal crash that
OL,7,Fsaw a bin lorry hit a building have
OL,8,Finterviewed a 51-year-old man.
OL,10,FHe spoke to officers voluntarily in
OL,11,Fconnection with the collision in
OL,12,FLeominster last November in which a
OL,13,Fpassenger, a man in his 60s, died and
OL,14,Ftwo other people were seriously
OL,15,Finjured.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
