OL,3,GNEWSAFatal bin lorry crash police
OL,4,Ainterview man
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe crash happened at the junction of
OL,7,FMill, Bridge and Broad streets, with
OL,8,Fthe injured pair later airlifted to
OL,9,Fhospital in Birmingham after crews had
OL,10,Fdifficulties rescuing them because the
OL,11,Fcrash had left the empty building
OL,12,Funstable.
OL,14,FHerefordshire Council previously
OL,15,Fconfirmed the man who died in the
OL,16,Fcrash, which continues to be
OL,17,Finvestigated by police, worked for its
OL,18,Fcontractor FCC Environment.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
